ippara.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Green_Bee-eater_%28Merops_orientalis%29_%40_Madayippara.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Green_Bee-eater_%28Merops_orientalis%29_%40_Madayippara.jpg/960px-Green_Bee-eater_%28Merops_orientalis%29_%40_Madayippara.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Bee-eater_(Merops_orientalis)_@_Madayippara.jpg","author":"Vivek Puliyeri","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","origin":null},"audio":null,"audioFromSearch":false,"video":{"file":"Green Bee-eater nepal.ogv","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Green_Bee-eater_nepal.ogv","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Green_Bee-eater_nepal.ogv/330px--Green_Bee-eater_nepal.ogv.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Bee-eater_nepal.ogv","author":"Aviceda","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","origin":null}},{"id":"Q244368","ar":"وروار صغير","sci":"Merops pusillus","en":"Little Bee-eater","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2548210125,"head":"وروار","root":null,"arwiki":{"title":"وروار صغير","rev":63708226,"text":["وروار صغير (الاسم العلمي: Merops pusillus) هو نوع من الطيور يتبع جنس الوروار من فصيلة الوروارية."]},"enwiki":"Little bee-eater","image":{"file":"Little Bee-eater (Merops pusillus pusillus), Kotu Beach, Gambia.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/Little_Bee-eater_%28Merops_pusillus_pusillus%29%2C_Kotu_Beach%2C_Gambia.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Little_Bee-eater_%28Merops_pusillus_pusillus%29%2C_Kotu_Beach%2C_Gambia.jpg/960px-Little_Bee-eater_%28Merops_pusillus_pusillus%29%2C_Kotu_Beach%2C_Gambia.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Little_Bee-eater_(Merops_pusillus_pusillus),_Kotu_Beach,_Gambia.jpg","author":"Charles J. Sharp","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUr